</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">F</harm>
</measure>
</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We all can do so many things,</l><l>But first of all to Christ we’ll cling;</l><l>Enjoy Him, blessings then He’ll bring,</l><l>His life-supply means everything!</l><l>Enjoy Him—grace He will bestow,</l><l>And we’ll be led to join the flow;</l><l>Yes, we will do all things in Him.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
